 y hasta 15.000 euros, justo por debajo del límite legal. Si esos importes se repartieran como en la franja inmediatamente inferior, lo esperable serían 19,6 contratos. La razón entre observados y esperados es 3,4, con un intervalo de confianza del 95 % de 2,5 a 4,7. En diciembre se adjudicó el 7 % de los contratos junto al límite, mientras que diciembre supone el 9 % de todos sus contratos de servicios y suministros. Los contratos junto al límite se reparten entre 59 adjudicatarios distintos. El contrato [1], de 14.256,17 euros, se adjudicó en diciembre de 2025.\nQué no pueden demostrar: La concentración de contratos al límite no indica malas prácticas. Puede deberse a circunstancias como presupuestos cerrados o necesidades específicas. No hay datos que confirman abusos o errores.\nQué se puede revisar: Comprobar si los contratos [1], [2], [3] abarcan la misma necesidad. Verificar si el adjudicatario A repite contratos en áreas distintas. Analizar si los contratos al límite coinciden con periodos de alta demanda.","en":"What the data shows: Between 2023 and 2025, this body awarded 67 minor contracts for services and supplies above 14,000 and up to 15,000 euros, just under the legal limit. If those amounts were spread as in the band immediately below, 19.6 contracts would be expected. The observed-to-expected ratio is 3.4, with a 95% confidence interval of 2.5 to 4.7. December accounts for 7% of the contracts just under the limit, compared with 9% of all its services and supplies contracts. The contracts just under the limit are spread across 59 different awardees. Contract [1], for 14,256.17 euros, was awarded in December 2025.\nWhat it cannot show: The concentration of contracts in December does not indicate improper activity. Similar distribution could result from standard scheduling. The number of different contractors does not prove any single contract was improperly structured.\nWhat can be checked: Check if December contracts were for similar services. Verify if awardee A's contracts were for overlapping needs. Review contract [1] to ensure the amount was within budget and not a result of price fluctuations.","origen_es":"modelo","origen_en":"modelo","modelo":"Qwen3-4B (Q4_K_M, llama.cpp)","regla":"ss","citas":["fXqiT%2BwCk0WHCIsjvJ3rhQ%3D%3D","UIfiWbltjddt5r0ngvMetA%3D%3D","jVyVf7o1FlSExvMJXBMHHQ%3D%3D"],"generado":"2026-11-16"}}